15","title":"御史大夫","kind":"office","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p008","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/107.json"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji107-013:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p008","start":15,"end":19,"surface":"御史大夫","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m008-0012","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p008","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/107.json"}]},"end":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"deposition","date_expression":"建元二年","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p008","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/107.json"}],"normalized_date":{"era":"BCE","era_year":139,"year":-138,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"魏其、武安俱好儒術，推轂趙綰為御史大夫，王臧為郎中令。迎魯申公，欲設明堂，令列侯就國，除關，以禮為服制，以興太平。舉適諸竇宗室毋節行者，除其屬籍。時諸外家為列侯，列侯多尚公主，皆不欲就國，以故毀日至竇太后。太后好黃老之言，而魏其、武安、趙綰、王臧等務隆推儒術，貶道家言，是以竇太后滋不說魏其等。及建元二年，御史大夫趙綰請無奏事東宮。竇太后大怒，乃罷逐趙綰、王臧等，而免丞相、太尉，以柏至侯許昌為丞相，武彊侯莊青翟為御史大夫。魏其、武安由此以侯家居。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p008","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/107.json"}],"references":[{"title":"漢初月朔考索──以出土簡牘為線索","author":"許名瑲","publication":"北市大語文學報","issue":12,"published_on":"2014-12","url":"https://literacy.utaipei.edu.tw/var/file/65/1065/img/1007/256705145.pdf","page":"121","scope":"regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"研究第121頁明列建元二年為前139年；同一建元紀年元年暫換前140年、六年前135年。只記年對照，不推公曆月日或驗證研究中的月朔改讀。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}}},"interpretation_note":"按明示拜、為、免、罷逐與坐法去官區分授任與終點。既任官只作來源用稱；職位轉移不另補前官終止日。數月、數歲保留相